## 1. Braze fixture (differential expansion, TZM leaf springs)
thermal interference Cu stack vs TZM rods: 0.137 mm at 795 C
target pressure 0.08 MPa -> 1250 N per plate; 8 TZM springs 80.0x20.0x2.5: k 683.59 N/mm each, 5468.8 N/mm total
hot deflection 0.229 mm; cold preload set 0.092 mm (502 N cold); spring stress hot 150 MPa (TZM 800 C yield ~450)
  shim error -0.05 mm -> hot load 977 N = 0.062 MPa
  shim error +0.05 mm -> hot load 1523 N = 0.098 MPa
plenum wall axial 0.77 MPa; fin metal (50 % solid) 0.16 MPa; separator span 6.914/1.8 fixed strip 0.59 MPa; arch hoop 0.48 MPa; OFE hot 0.2 % proof ~10 MPa

## 2. Vacuum furnace capacity
cycle 5.5 h, 3.52 loads/day, 60 plates/load -> 77,168 brazed plates per furnace-year
   10,000/yr at yield 0.84: 0.15 furnaces
  100,000/yr at yield 0.935: 1.39 furnaces

